From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 08:09:10 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Fix hall pass timers starting at non-zero time

Timers subtracted Firebase server timestamps from the device clock
(Date.now()), so any device with clock drift showed timers starting
offset from 0:00 (or negative), and skewed durations/auto-resets.
Add serverNow() using .info/serverTimeOffset and use it for all
elapsed-time math; clamp fmt() at 0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RDdXAeU5pq8VJQjaL6XnLp
